{
  "description": "Binomial trial accumulator — each run flips n coins with bias p and drops the head-count into a histogram that converges to the overlaid theoretical binomial PMF, on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
